# Life node, March to October, fallback only: from 05:00 for 6 hours and from 20:00 for 2 hours, at fixed local clock
# time. A fixed clock cannot follow the sun, so it is wider than the windows (4 h from civil dawn and 1 h from sunset)
# to hold them on most days; the readings count only the windows themselves. life-schedule writes the schedule computed
# for the node's place instead, and uses this file only if that computation fails
BEGIN	2026-03-01 05:00:00
END	2035-12-31 23:59:59
ON	H6
OFF	H9
ON	H2
OFF	H7
